    "set.memberOrder":"Family order","set.memberOrderDesc":"This order is used on the home screen and in lists.","set.backup":"Backup","set.backupDesc":"Basically stored on this device. While family sharing is on, records of members set to “Shared” also sync to the server. ","set.backupDesc2":"Export important data to keep it safe.","cb.title":"Cloud backup","cb.desc":"When on, a copy of all your data (except photos) is automatically saved to your signed-in account. If you open the app on another device or in another browser, you can restore it just by signing in. This is separate from family sharing — your family cannot see it. Photos are stored only on this device.","cb.needSignIn":"You need to sign in to use this.","cb.signIn":"Sign in","cb.autoLabel":"Automatic backup","cb.on":"On","cb.off":"Off","cb.statusOff":"Turned off","cb.statusNone":"No backup yet","cb.statusLast":"Last backup: {date}","cb.statusBusy":"Backing up…","cb.statusError":"Backup failed. Please check your connection.","cb.statusTooBig":"Your data is too large to back up","cb.now":"Back up now","cb.restoreBtn":"Restore from backup","cb.none":"No backup found in the cloud","cb.backedUp":"Backed up","cb.foundTitle":"Backup found","cb.foundBody":"You have a backup from {date}. Restore it on this device? Photos are not included in backups, so they won't be restored. Restoring also turns on automatic backup on this device.","cb.restoreTitle":"Restore from backup?","cb.restoreBody":"The data on this device will be overwritten with the backup from {date}. Photos are not included in backups, so they won't be restored.","cb.doRestore":"Restore","cb.restored":"Restored","cb.restoreFail":"Could not restore","backup.export":"Export data (with photos)","backup.exportCsv":"Export records as CSV","backup.restoreWarn":"Restoring overwrites your current data with the backup. Continue?","backup.chooseFile":"Choose a file to restore","backup.restore":"Restore from backup",
    "set.familyShare":"Family sharing","share.settings":"Sharing settings",
    "set.about":"About","about.help":"How it works","about.whatsNew":"What's new","about.tourAgain":"Replay the walkthrough","about.aboutApp":"About this app","about.reset":"Erase data & start over","about.privacyBody":"Your records and photos are basically stored on this device. Only when you use family sharing, the profiles and records of members set to “Shared” are stored on Google Firebase (Tokyo) and synced with your family. Photos are synced too, as smaller copies made for sharing. Only when you turn on cloud backup, all of your data (excluding photos) is stored on Firebase (Tokyo) linked to your account, and only you can restore it. Your own “Me” records and members set to “Only me” are never shared. If you hand someone a public link or a backup file yourself, its contents will be visible to them. You can export a backup from Settings.","about.analyticsBody":"To understand how the app is used, we measure screen views and feature use (we never send the contents of your records or photos). For weather, your saved locations are sent to a weather API.","about.shareBody":"From “Family sharing” in Settings or the menu, you can create a family space or join with an invite code. The profiles and records of members set to “Shared” are shared. Photos are shared too, as smaller copies made for sharing. You can choose “Shared / Only me” in each member's profile. If there are many photos, the most recent ones are shared first.",
